- Start from `docs/commercial/README.md` and `docs/commercial/OFFER_IDENTITY_AND_NAMING_POLICY.md`.
- The only public paid offer is Agent Action Security Review at €2,500 excluding VAT. External Attack Surface Review is parked: keep the historical record, and do not sell it or present it as the agent review.
- The public contact address is `engage@mail.witnessops.com` only.
- Delivery timing for the public offer is `Delivery timing per signed SOW`.
- Held or historical prices and terms tracked in the commercial registry must never appear on public surfaces or in new-sales selection. Read them from `apps/witnessops-web/src/lib/commercial-truth.ts` and `apps/witnessops-web/src/lib/historical-held-term-surfaces.test.tsx`. Do not copy those held literals into current public copy.
- The private pilot is not a public offer. The free hostname check is not a third paid review.
- Keep historical offer records for old lookups. Preserve their names. Do not rename them onto a current offer, and do not present them as new public offers. That includes AI Agent Tools & Access Review, Public Exposure Review, Customer Security Review Sprint, One Server Security Check, Agent Risk & Control Review, Agent Workflow Reconstruction, and Early Bird — Internet Footprint Review.
- Naming policy does not grant rename, billing, collection, migration, or deployment authority.
- Buyer-path changes also need `pnpm smoke:buyer-path:test`.
